### Controle Ja API - Recurrence Rules Contract
### Base path publico: /controle_ja_api/v1/transactions
### Observacao: recurrence_rules nao possui controller proprio hoje.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/controle_ja_api/v1
@accessToken = coloque_o_access_token_aqui
@accountId = coloque_o_uuid_da_conta_aqui
@targetAccountId = coloque_o_uuid_da_conta_destino_aqui
@categoryId = coloque_o_uuid_da_categoria_aqui
@transactionId = coloque_o_uuid_da_transacao_aqui

### Resumo do fluxo
### - Uma regra nasce quando a transacao chega com isFixed=true e recurrenceFrequency.
### - A regra guarda valor base, frequencia, data inicial, data final opcional, usuario, categoria e contas.
### - Projecoes futuras sao criadas por TransactionService.generateProjectionsForRule.
### - Worker usa RecurrenceRuleService.findAllActiveRules e projeta ate 1 ano a frente.
### - Alteracoes com OperationScope.FROM_THIS_FORWARD atualizam/cancelam futuras nao pagas.
### - Alteracoes com OperationScope.ONLY_THIS afetam somente o lancamento atual.

### Create Fixed Expense
### Request minimo: name, type, amount, date, accountId, categoryId, paid, isFixed, recurrenceFrequency.
### Response 200: transaction com recurrenceRuleId e recurrenceFrequency.
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Internet",
  "description": "Mensalidade",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 120.00,
  "date": 1761955200000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "paid": false,
  "isFixed": true,
  "recurrenceFrequency": "MONTHLY",
  "recurrenceEndDate": null
}

### Create Fixed Transfer
### Decision: gera par de transacoes projetadas, saida e entrada.
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reserva mensal",
  "type": "TRANSFERENCIA",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "date": 1761955200000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{targetAccountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "paid": true,
  "isFixed": true,
  "recurrenceFrequency": "MONTHLY"
}

### Update Only This
### Decision: altera somente a transacao atual.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=ONLY_THIS
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Internet ajustada",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 130.00,
  "date": 1761955200000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "paid": false,
  "isFixed": true,
  "recurrenceFrequency": "MONTHLY"
}

### Update From This Forward
### Decision: encerra ou atualiza a regra anterior e aplica nas futuras nao pagas.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=FROM_THIS_FORWARD
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Internet reajustada",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 145.00,
  "date": 1761955200000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "paid": false,
  "isFixed": true,
  "recurrenceFrequency": "MONTHLY"
}

### Delete Only This
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=ONLY_THIS
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete From This Forward
### Decision: cancela regra e remove futuras nao pagas, preservando lancamentos ja pagos.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=FROM_THIS_FORWARD
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

